{"id":"muet","lemma":"muet","pos":"adj","rank":4327,"glosses":["dumb (unable to talk)","silent, mute, unspeaking","silent, unvoiced, unspoken"],"ipa":"/mɥɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/67/Fr-muet.ogg/Fr-muet.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"muette","masculinePlural":"muets","femininePlural":"muettes"},"formAudio":{"muette":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-muette.wav","muets":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-muets.wav","muettes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-muettes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il est resté muet.","en":"He remained dumb.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095569","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to stay","l":"rester"},null]},{"text":"Je déteste les films muets.","en":"I hate silent movies.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},null]},{"text":"Elle était aveugle, sourde et muette.","en":"She was blind, deaf, and dumb.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"blind"},{"g":"deaf","l":"sourd"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Le pauvre enfant était né sourd-muet.","en":"The poor child was born deaf and dumb.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"poor"},{"g":"child"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to be born","l":"naître"},{"g":"deaf"},null]},{"text":"Tu aimes les films muets ?","en":"Do you like silent movies?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"movie, film","l":"film"},null]}]}